{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17904","headline":"至日登乐游园 · 裴度","name":"至日登乐游园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴律随寒改，阳和应节生。\n祥云观魏阙，瑞气映秦城。\n验炭论时政，书云受岁盈。\n晷移长日至，雾敛远霄清。\n景暖仙梅动，风柔御柳倾。\n那堪封得意，空对物华情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}